  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Sarah (electricity cuts)** (1 other source): After the power cut, the band teased a Bob Dylan song called Sara, then Uncle Fucker [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Sara - Bob Dylan (tease)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Uncle Fucker (tease)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Ween leaves**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Beck over house speakers**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1999-07-24** (recommended): audience recording; 30 songs; 138 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The venue cut the electricity during Sarah because a comedian needed to perform [1]\n- Ween left the stage and Beck played over the house speakers afterward [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1999-07-24**: source: unknown AUD [1]",
